# Sales Performance Analysis Using MySQL

## 📊 Project Overview

This project is an end-to-end sales data analysis project developed using MySQL and MySQL Workbench.

The project analyzes a dataset containing 20,000 sales transactions to demonstrate SQL data cleaning, data validation, KPI reporting, sales performance analysis, product analysis, customer analysis, regional analysis, and business reporting.

The objective is to transform raw sales data into structured information that can support business decision-making.

---

## 🎯 Project Objectives

The main objectives of this project were to:

- Clean and validate the sales dataset
- Analyze overall business performance
- Calculate key sales and profitability KPIs
- Identify sales trends over time
- Identify top-performing products and categories
- Analyze customer segments
- Evaluate regional performance
- Analyze sales channels and payment methods
- Examine discounts and their relationship with profitability
- Generate business insights and recommendations

